    "After an account is deleted, data will be retained for 90 days (for anti-fraud and recovery purposes) before being permanently deleted, including usage logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After an account is deleted, data will be retained for 90 days (for anti-fraud and recovery purposes) before being permanently deleted, including usage logs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号删除后，数据将保留 90 天（用于反欺诈和恢复目的），然后永久删除，包括使用日志。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除帳號後，資料將保留 90 天（用於反詐欺與找回），隨後徹底刪除，包括用量日誌。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tras eliminar una cuenta, los datos se conservan 90 días (con fines antifraude y de recuperación) antes de borrarse definitivamente, incluidos los registros de uso."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après la suppression d'un compte, les données sont conservées pendant 90 jours (à des fins d'antifraude et de récupération) avant d'être définitivement supprimées, journaux d'utilisation compris."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After authenticating, remote LLM conversations are proxied through api.polang.net to the LLM provider for the current request only. The server only records call counts and token usage, not conversation content.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After authenticating, remote LLM conversations are proxied through api.polang.net to the LLM provider for the current request only. The server only records call counts and token usage, not conversation content."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "认证后，远程 LLM 对话经 api.polang.net 代理转发至 LLM 供应商，仅处理当前请求。服务器只记录调用次数和 Token 用量，不记录对话内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入後，遠端 LLM 對話經 api.polang.net 代理轉發至 LLM 供應商，僅用於本次請求。伺服器僅記錄呼叫次數與 Token 用量，不儲存對話內容。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de autenticarte, las conversaciones con LLM remotos se envían a través de api.polang.net al proveedor de LLM solo para la solicitud actual. El servidor solo registra el número de llamadas y el uso de tokens, no el contenido de las conversaciones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après authentification, les conversations LLM distantes passent par api.polang.net pour atteindre le fournisseur LLM, uniquement pour la requête en cours. Le serveur n'enregistre que le nombre d'appels et la consommation de jetons, jamais le contenu des conversations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
